(944988, 110143, 27523, '<td valign="top">Maybe cropped a little (only a little) more off the bottom? Still I do like :-)</td>', 'Maybe cropped a little (only a little) more off the bottom? Still I do like :-)', '2004-10-06 07:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(944990, 110485, 25486, '<td valign="top">Very moody shot.  You picked out the detail within the whole image well.  I think the DOF is about right, keeps the attention in the middle of the frame.  There''s a lot of people who say don''t use a border in the challenges but I like it in this case.  Well done.</td>', 'Very moody shot.  You picked out the detail within the whole image well.  I think the DOF is about right, keeps the attention in the middle of the frame.  There''s a lot of people who say don''t use a border in the challenges but I like it in this case.  Well done.', '2004-10-06 08:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(944994, 110454, 25486, '<td valign="top">We will have to see if people think this fits the challenge or not.  I think it is debateable.  I like the image but there are others which I think meet the challenge better.</td>', 'We will have to see if people think this fits the challenge or not.  I think it is debateable.  I like the image but there are others which I think meet the challenge better.', '2004-10-06 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(944998, 109815, 25486, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and colour.  You did very well to pick this out from the whole scene.  The sky really brings out the tones of the stone.  The shadows are nice and deep and the highlights are not over exposed.  Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and colour.  You did very well to pick this out from the whole scene.  The sky really brings out the tones of the stone.  The shadows are nice and deep and the highlights are not over exposed.  Very well done.', '2004-10-06 08:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(944999, 109509, 318, '<td valign="top">I think the wacky food challenge is over. :)</td>', 'I think the wacky food challenge is over. :)', '2004-10-06 08:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(945000, 110506, 24457, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the claws.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the claws.', '2004-10-06 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(945001, 110556, 25486, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull image.  I love the silky sheen of the cranks, (is that the right word?).  Focussing a DOF are spot on.  Fits the challenge very well.  The colour sets if off very well.  I think if anything I would have tried cropping more of he dark area at the top, perhaps as far down as just above the unpainted main bearing.  Very well done.</td>', 'Wonderfull image.  I love the silky sheen of the cranks, (is that the right word?).  Focussing a DOF are spot on.  Fits the challenge very well.  The colour sets if off very well.  I think if anything I would have tried cropping more of he dark area at the top, perhaps as far down as just above the unpainted main bearing.  Very well done.', '2004-10-06 08:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(945002, 109956, 24457, '<td valign="top">Interesting pic, I like the "shinyness", but out of curiosity, what''s it a part of?</td>', 'Interesting pic, I like the "shinyness", but out of curiosity, what''s it a part of?', '2004-10-06 08:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(945003, 110361, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting makes this stand out from the background.  Not sure how well it fits the Pieces title though, as almost all of the object is visible.</td>', 'Nice lighting makes this stand out from the background.  Not sure how well it fits the Pieces title though, as almost all of the object is visible.', '2004-10-06 08:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(945004, 110118, 24457, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha, I like the title! Good picture too.</td>', 'Ha ha ha, I like the title! Good picture too.', '2004-10-06 08:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(945006, 109356, 24457, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-10-06 08:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(945007, 110515, 24457, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-10-06 08:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(945008, 110132, 24457, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus for my tastes.</td>', 'Too out of focus for my tastes.', '2004-10-06 08:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(945009, 109688, 24457, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup.</td>', 'Nice closeup.', '2004-10-06 08:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(945010, 110555, 25486, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and lighting.  Nicely picked out the detail.  Good DOF and the angle is just about right.  Shame about the scratches or dust on the levers though.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellent colour and lighting.  Nicely picked out the detail.  Good DOF and the angle is just about right.  Shame about the scratches or dust on the levers though.  Well done.', '2004-10-06 08:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(945011, 110263, 24457, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like it.</td>', 'Very nice, I like it.', '2004-10-06 08:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(945012, 110233, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s a bolt behind the pointing figure, but it seems too long for the missing bolt on the diagram. Good idea, though.</td>', 'Well, there''s a bolt behind the pointing figure, but it seems too long for the missing bolt on the diagram. Good idea, though.', '2004-10-06 08:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(945013, 110246, 25486, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, fits the challenge well enough.  The colours and sharpness seem a touch overdone?  Although it gives texture to the image.  Doesn''t have quite the interest of some of the stronger images.</td>', 'Interesting image, fits the challenge well enough.  The colours and sharpness seem a touch overdone?  Although it gives texture to the image.  Doesn''t have quite the interest of some of the stronger images.', '2004-10-06 08:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(945015, 109242, 24457, '<td valign="top">I like the effect with the second hand.</td>', 'I like the effect with the second hand.', '2004-10-06 08:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(945017, 110346, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea ans good effort.  The parts are there but not as interesting to look at as some.  The lighting has caused some over exposure of part of the image and its direction doesn''t give the old machine much texture or colour.  A coloured or more diffused light may have given better results.</td>', 'Nice idea ans good effort.  The parts are there but not as interesting to look at as some.  The lighting has caused some over exposure of part of the image and its direction doesn''t give the old machine much texture or colour.  A coloured or more diffused light may have given better results.', '2004-10-06 08:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(945020, 110292, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool, stark image that works well for this challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool, stark image that works well for this challenge. Nice job.', '2004-10-06 08:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(945022, 110566, 24457, '<td valign="top">Neat effect.</td>', 'Neat effect.', '2004-10-06 08:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(945023, 108981, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice story, interestingly told.</td>', 'Nice story, interestingly told.', '2004-10-06 08:28:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(945026, 110508, 24457, '<td valign="top">I like it! I just wish the purple pen had been up against the blue one, like the rest are... Good colors.</td>', 'I like it! I just wish the purple pen had been up against the blue one, like the rest are... Good colors.', '2004-10-06 08:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(945027, 110364, 24457, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the title...</td>', 'Nice effect with the title...', '2004-10-06 08:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(945028, 109275, 24457, '<td valign="top">Very nice catch!</td>', 'Very nice catch!', '2004-10-06 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(945029, 110434, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I think closer would have been better, to bring out the texture of the saw blade and the log.  The framing seems a bit off to me, too much happening at the left.  I think the slightly burn out area of grass accentuates this.  Very nice effort.</td>', 'Nice idea, I think closer would have been better, to bring out the texture of the saw blade and the log.  The framing seems a bit off to me, too much happening at the left.  I think the slightly burn out area of grass accentuates this.  Very nice effort.', '2004-10-06 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(945033, 110228, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, well picked out.  I like the directional lighting and the colour.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice detail, well picked out.  I like the directional lighting and the colour.  Well done.', '2004-10-06 08:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(945034, 109992, 25486, '<td valign="top">Amazing what you can find when you really look closely.  Well done.</td>', 'Amazing what you can find when you really look closely.  Well done.', '2004-10-06 08:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(945035, 109672, 25679, '<td valign="top">I think cropping the chair out would help this photo.</td>', 'I think cropping the chair out would help this photo.', '2004-10-06 08:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(945038, 109406, 25486, '<td valign="top">Brings out the texture of the old wood really well.  Nicely cropped.  Couldn''t help myself from wondering what that is on the other side though, which distracted me from the main subject.</td>', 'Brings out the texture of the old wood really well.  Nicely cropped.  Couldn''t help myself from wondering what that is on the other side though, which distracted me from the main subject.', '2004-10-06 08:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(945040, 110431, 25679, '<td valign="top">great idea.  needed to get the focus on the eye instead of the nose.</td>', 'great idea.  needed to get the focus on the eye instead of the nose.', '2004-10-06 08:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(945045, 109188, 25679, '<td valign="top">needs more contrast.</td>', 'needs more contrast.', '2004-10-06 08:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(945048, 109136, 25679, '<td valign="top">bad crop</td>', 'bad crop', '2004-10-06 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
