(945088, 110265, 25330, '<td valign="top">This image is compelling and beautiful.  But I rated it a bit low because of the lack of detail.  I suspect that was intended.  But I keep wondering if I''d like this better with a litte more sharpness and/or contrast--or maybe a contrasting background.</td>', 'This image is compelling and beautiful.  But I rated it a bit low because of the lack of detail.  I suspect that was intended.  But I keep wondering if I''d like this better with a litte more sharpness and/or contrast--or maybe a contrasting background.', '2004-10-06 09:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
