(945198, 109758, 26757, '<td valign="top">Funny... Every child does this trick with a flashlight...  Good idea for the challenge.  As a help for next time... focus the camera on the knuckles prior to having someone switch on the flashlight and turn off the overhead, so that the focus is sharp and clear.  Could have been wonderful<br/>ginette</td>', 'Funny... Every child does this trick with a flashlight...  Good idea for the challenge.  As a help for next time... focus the camera on the knuckles prior to having someone switch on the flashlight and turn off the overhead, so that the focus is sharp and clear.  Could have been wonderfulginette', '2004-10-06 10:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
