(945930, 110387, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like an image which can instantly convey an idea or conjure up a story, this does that for me.  The colours are nice and even which works well here.  The sky is a little burnt out but not too bad.  Well done.  I also like the paronraminc crop.</td>', 'I like an image which can instantly convey an idea or conjure up a story, this does that for me.  The colours are nice and even which works well here.  The sky is a little burnt out but not too bad.  Well done.  I also like the paronraminc crop.', '2004-10-06 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
