(945953, 109916, 27524, '<td valign="top">Ohh...you touch the strings of my heart :)) BMW... and good in sepia.</td>', 'Ohh...you touch the strings of my heart :)) BMW... and good in sepia.', '2004-10-06 15:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(945956, 110028, 25486, '<td valign="top">A good idea, nice colours but it kinds of lacks character in my opinion.  Its a bit "sterile" if you see what I mean.  Perhaps that how you wanted it?  I would have scored it higher if it had more "character" (for want of a better word).  Just my opinion though.</td>', 'A good idea, nice colours but it kinds of lacks character in my opinion.  Its a bit "sterile" if you see what I mean.  Perhaps that how you wanted it?  I would have scored it higher if it had more "character" (for want of a better word).  Just my opinion though.', '2004-10-06 15:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
