(946006, 109145, 22781, '<td valign="top">Looks like something I did in the backlighting challenge...<br/>Well, if it looks like mine, i must like it i guess, 8</td>', 'Looks like something I did in the backlighting challenge...Well, if it looks like mine, i must like it i guess, 8', '2004-10-06 15:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
