(946010, 110481, 25486, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint, warm colours, good use of DOF.  I can hear the music...wish I could play it.  I can''t help thinking that it may have been better with the point of focus one or two hammers further down the row?  You didn''t take some others with different POF did you?  Especially with the one in focus in a different position, as if about the strike?  Or am I getting carried away here?</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint, warm colours, good use of DOF.  I can hear the music...wish I could play it.  I can''t help thinking that it may have been better with the point of focus one or two hammers further down the row?  You didn''t take some others with different POF did you?  Especially with the one in focus in a different position, as if about the strike?  Or am I getting carried away here?', '2004-10-06 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(946014, 110427, 27524, '<td valign="top">Original compozition... mix of art and architecture...</td>', 'Original compozition... mix of art and architecture...', '2004-10-06 15:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(946015, 110327, 25486, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent abstract shot, wonderful tones, you can almost reach out and feel the texture and the weight.  Great observation, well captured.</td>', 'This is an excellent abstract shot, wonderful tones, you can almost reach out and feel the texture and the weight.  Great observation, well captured.', '2004-10-06 15:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
