(946098, 110445, 25486, '<td valign="top">First of all I liked the colours in this shot, then it made me think about what the horse was thinking (sad maybe)?  Good DOF use with just enough detail to give it life and make it interesting.  Very well done.</td>', 'First of all I liked the colours in this shot, then it made me think about what the horse was thinking (sad maybe)?  Good DOF use with just enough detail to give it life and make it interesting.  Very well done.', '2004-10-06 16:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(946099, 110033, 14476, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, part of the vine, part of the truck:meets the challenge.  Quite good color.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop a bit lower on the blue truck to get rid of the half letters there, and also probably might try a different viewpoint to eliminate the house which is slightly distracting.  Still, nice photo.</td>', 'Hmmm, part of the vine, part of the truck:meets the challenge.  Quite good color.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop a bit lower on the blue truck to get rid of the half letters there, and also probably might try a different viewpoint to eliminate the house which is slightly distracting.  Still, nice photo.', '2004-10-06 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(946105, 108853, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love the textures on these old fence posts and the barbwire is perfect for the composition.  While I wish there was just a bit more saturation in the colors, it''s a nice composition and I can see why you liked the subject.</td>', 'Love the textures on these old fence posts and the barbwire is perfect for the composition.  While I wish there was just a bit more saturation in the colors, it''s a nice composition and I can see why you liked the subject.', '2004-10-06 16:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(946107, 109991, 27524, '<td valign="top">Well done compozition... Good focus.</td>', 'Well done compozition... Good focus.', '2004-10-06 16:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(946108, 110567, 14476, '<td valign="top">Looks a little like sunrise or sunset, doesn''t it.  I might have cropped a bit from the top to get rid of that artifact in the upper left, but that is ''nit picking'' as it is a very nice image.</td>', 'Looks a little like sunrise or sunset, doesn''t it.  I might have cropped a bit from the top to get rid of that artifact in the upper left, but that is ''nit picking'' as it is a very nice image.', '2004-10-06 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(946111, 109379, 25486, '<td valign="top">Well spotted, (or should that be striped, sorry) The contrasting textures work well together.  Nice lighting.  The upright trunk does get in the way a bit.  If you could have used it to frame the shot a bit more it might have been better?</td>', 'Well spotted, (or should that be striped, sorry) The contrasting textures work well together.  Nice lighting.  The upright trunk does get in the way a bit.  If you could have used it to frame the shot a bit more it might have been better?', '2004-10-06 16:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(946114, 109134, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and soft focus.</td>', 'Nice colors and soft focus.', '2004-10-06 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(946115, 110393, 27204, '<td valign="top">That''s amazing!  Something as simple as a goblet turns into art.  The blue works really well with the glass.</td>', 'That''s amazing!  Something as simple as a goblet turns into art.  The blue works really well with the glass.', '2004-10-06 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(946119, 109097, 22734, '<td valign="top">A rather in your face study with great line movement to invite a second look. The colors are very pungent but well harmonized.  The shoelace gives it the ballast needed to accompdate the angle. Very well composed. Super 7</td>', 'A rather in your face study with great line movement to invite a second look. The colors are very pungent but well harmonized.  The shoelace gives it the ballast needed to accompdate the angle. Very well composed. Super 7', '2004-10-06 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(946124, 110261, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice but hard to get full impression on such small piece.</td>', 'Nice but hard to get full impression on such small piece.', '2004-10-06 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(946125, 108655, 25486, '<td valign="top">I think boith hands would have been better.  The top of the dark area shows something in the background which is distracting.  The tone is nice and warm but for me it lacks a "story" or a point of particular interest.  The hand is the perhaps the most interesting part and it is leading the eye out of the shot.  Just my opinion anyway.</td>', 'I think boith hands would have been better.  The top of the dark area shows something in the background which is distracting.  The tone is nice and warm but for me it lacks a "story" or a point of particular interest.  The hand is the perhaps the most interesting part and it is leading the eye out of the shot.  Just my opinion anyway.', '2004-10-06 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(946128, 110487, 27204, '<td valign="top">I love the crisscross design.  However, the shadows seem a bit distracting...</td>', 'I love the crisscross design.  However, the shadows seem a bit distracting...', '2004-10-06 16:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(946135, 110057, 27636, '<td valign="top">I''ve said it before... I like simplicity - nice shot</td>', 'I''ve said it before... I like simplicity - nice shot', '2004-10-06 16:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
