(946637, 109200, 5746, '<td valign="top">Stunning. I love everything, even the border :)<br/>So elegant. And you didn''t even have to make a direct description in the title (which is great). To me - this is what this challenge is about.</td>', 'Stunning. I love everything, even the border :)So elegant. And you didn''t even have to make a direct description in the title (which is great). To me - this is what this challenge is about.', '2004-10-06 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
