(946653, 109188, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea and I like the composition.  I think it needs to be leveled--the white clouds don''t look white to me, and contrast is low.  I think with some added contrast, this would score much higher..  Also, I think a wider (landscape) view might have been nice!</td>', 'This is a good idea and I like the composition.  I think it needs to be leveled--the white clouds don''t look white to me, and contrast is low.  I think with some added contrast, this would score much higher..  Also, I think a wider (landscape) view might have been nice!', '2004-10-06 20:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
