(946747, 110131, 12253, '<td valign="top">I really like this but I think the composition could be stronger.  The dark bar to the right should be cropped out, and I think much of the bottom with the green background as well.  The contrast between the purple flowers and the frosted/distored glass works very well as an abstract (and of course would even be more appropos for part).  Hope to see more versions of this later!</td>', 'I really like this but I think the composition could be stronger.  The dark bar to the right should be cropped out, and I think much of the bottom with the green background as well.  The contrast between the purple flowers and the frosted/distored glass works very well as an abstract (and of course would even be more appropos for part).  Hope to see more versions of this later!', '2004-10-06 20:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(946749, 110516, 25218, '<td valign="top">I really like how the shadow reveals the full shape of the lamp. and the texture of the stucco</td>', 'I really like how the shadow reveals the full shape of the lamp. and the texture of the stucco', '2004-10-06 20:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
