(947427, 110434, 14476, '<td valign="top">Clever use of words as well as a good take on the Challenge.  It might be my monitor, but I think that foreground grass is slightly OOF.  And  the background is a touch "hot".   But excellent composition and good title.</td>', 'Clever use of words as well as a good take on the Challenge.  It might be my monitor, but I think that foreground grass is slightly OOF.  And  the background is a touch "hot".   But excellent composition and good title.', '2004-10-07 02:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(947428, 110568, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2004-10-07 02:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(947429, 109379, 18799, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge but it''s really busy. My eyes have a hard time following it.</td>', 'It meets the challenge but it''s really busy. My eyes have a hard time following it.', '2004-10-07 02:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(947430, 110391, 14476, '<td valign="top">You''ve gone the extra mile in this photo and it shows.  Good composition, fine take on the challenge, maybee could be a bit sharper, still pretty darn good!  9</td>', 'You''ve gone the extra mile in this photo and it shows.  Good composition, fine take on the challenge, maybee could be a bit sharper, still pretty darn good!  9', '2004-10-07 02:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(947432, 109992, 14476, '<td valign="top">Spider webs are always fun to play with.  You did a good job with this one.  Maybe not quite dramatic enough to catch the eye of voters, but a good photographic image.</td>', 'Spider webs are always fun to play with.  You did a good job with this one.  Maybe not quite dramatic enough to catch the eye of voters, but a good photographic image.', '2004-10-07 02:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(947433, 110158, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo.  Colors are great!  My one composition nit would be that there (IMO) is too much room at the top that doesn''t add to the photo.  Still, 7</td>', 'Really nice photo.  Colors are great!  My one composition nit would be that there (IMO) is too much room at the top that doesn''t add to the photo.  Still, 7', '2004-10-07 02:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(947434, 108855, 14476, '<td valign="top">Forgive me if I say there is quite a lot of information in this image, but still not enough to tell us what is going on.  It surely does meet the challenge, but not a "zinger".</td>', 'Forgive me if I say there is quite a lot of information in this image, but still not enough to tell us what is going on.  It surely does meet the challenge, but not a "zinger".', '2004-10-07 02:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
