(947451, 110479, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, good composition (although the split almost exactly half-way across might be a touch difficult) but you have done a good job with an interesting presentation.</td>', 'Nice focus, good composition (although the split almost exactly half-way across might be a touch difficult) but you have done a good job with an interesting presentation.', '2004-10-07 02:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
