(947495, 109088, 5746, '<td valign="top">Looks like the clock had some spots (on the glass at the edge and on the left side of the image - under 1). The concept is good, pity these details came out :(<br/>I give it 7.</td>', 'Looks like the clock had some spots (on the glass at the edge and on the left side of the image - under 1). The concept is good, pity these details came out :(I give it 7.', '2004-10-07 04:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
