(947501, 110298, 5746, '<td valign="top">A brush. Hmm. I wish it has more colours. Like Van Gogh brush ;) The idea is interesting. I give it 5.</td>', 'A brush. Hmm. I wish it has more colours. Like Van Gogh brush ;) The idea is interesting. I give it 5.', '2004-10-07 04:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
