(947508, 108946, 5746, '<td valign="top">For the title, I would make a picture of the feathers on the top of peackock head only. Would''ve been nice to break the head "what the hell is it?". Pity, the background is boring and I think, since there is nothing happening in the background or around peackok, it would''ve been better to try and make a portrait out of it and give the background more decided colour. 5.</td>', 'For the title, I would make a picture of the feathers on the top of peackock head only. Would''ve been nice to break the head "what the hell is it?". Pity, the background is boring and I think, since there is nothing happening in the background or around peackok, it would''ve been better to try and make a portrait out of it and give the background more decided colour. 5.', '2004-10-07 04:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(947509, 108947, 24486, '<td valign="top">nice texture</td>', 'nice texture', '2004-10-07 04:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(947511, 109497, 5746, '<td valign="top">Light as a part of a lantern? I like the idea, I just would''ve cropped th building. The main effect is the light coming through the leaves - the building is obsolate I think. Did you change the colour or was it so warm and red? 6.</td>', 'Light as a part of a lantern? I like the idea, I just would''ve cropped th building. The main effect is the light coming through the leaves - the building is obsolate I think. Did you change the colour or was it so warm and red? 6.', '2004-10-07 04:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(947512, 109275, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice execution. A bit off topic to me :(</td>', 'Nice execution. A bit off topic to me :(', '2004-10-07 04:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(947513, 109285, 5746, '<td valign="top">Too much of the horse to my liking. Maybe an ear or the tail alone or only the back leg would''ve been better for the challenge topic? The background is not very fortunate :( 5.</td>', 'Too much of the horse to my liking. Maybe an ear or the tail alone or only the back leg would''ve been better for the challenge topic? The background is not very fortunate :( 5.', '2004-10-07 04:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(947514, 109812, 5746, '<td valign="top">There is actually one peace of you - your eye (preaty eye BTW).<br/>A bit too obvious. Why didn''t you try your ear? :)) 5.</td>', 'There is actually one peace of you - your eye (preaty eye BTW).A bit too obvious. Why didn''t you try your ear? :)) 5.', '2004-10-07 04:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(947518, 109314, 5746, '<td valign="top">That is interesting. Pity you didn''t clean the heel :)<br/>I like the idea. It was really hard to get a good idea (not so obvious) for this challenge. 8.</td>', 'That is interesting. Pity you didn''t clean the heel :)I like the idea. It was really hard to get a good idea (not so obvious) for this challenge. 8.', '2004-10-07 04:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(947519, 108975, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is the best eye photo in the challenge.</td>', 'This is the best eye photo in the challenge.', '2004-10-07 04:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(947520, 109412, 5746, '<td valign="top">Resembles one of the realistic paintings from the Soviet Union era :) (It is a compliment I adore pictures that look like paintings). I wish it was a bit more saturated. 6.</td>', 'Resembles one of the realistic paintings from the Soviet Union era :) (It is a compliment I adore pictures that look like paintings). I wish it was a bit more saturated. 6.', '2004-10-07 04:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(947521, 110502, 5746, '<td valign="top">:)))<br/>I like the contrast between the body of the machine and the bright marks. The angle is also interesting (makes you think what it is it). 7.</td>', ':)))I like the contrast between the body of the machine and the bright marks. The angle is also interesting (makes you think what it is it). 7.', '2004-10-07 04:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
