(947524, 109513, 5746, '<td valign="top">Is it art of the doors or part of the handle? If it was supposed to be a part of the door (or even a house) - the handle should stay. It adds the story behaind the image. Generally I like it. It has nice atmosphere. 8.</td>', 'Is it art of the doors or part of the handle? If it was supposed to be a part of the door (or even a house) - the handle should stay. It adds the story behaind the image. Generally I like it. It has nice atmosphere. 8.', '2004-10-07 04:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
