(947532, 110231, 5746, '<td valign="top">Maybe cap alone would''ve been better? And a different angle?  Now it''s so obvious...<br/>Good idea with sky as a backround for the cap.</td>', 'Maybe cap alone would''ve been better? And a different angle?  Now it''s so obvious...Good idea with sky as a backround for the cap.', '2004-10-07 04:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
