(947543, 109603, 5746, '<td valign="top">The picture is so small :(<br/>I think there should be only one arm of the crane. Now - it''s too much to treat it as a part. IMO. I give it 4 - mainly because of the size</td>', 'The picture is so small :(I think there should be only one arm of the crane. Now - it''s too much to treat it as a part. IMO. I give it 4 - mainly because of the size', '2004-10-07 04:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(947545, 110259, 5746, '<td valign="top">Maybe the hands should wear black gloves? Nice idea, clean shot. Just the hands... I don''t know. I expect to see the face between them. If there is no face, gloves would''ve fit perfectly :) 8.</td>', 'Maybe the hands should wear black gloves? Nice idea, clean shot. Just the hands... I don''t know. I expect to see the face between them. If there is no face, gloves would''ve fit perfectly :) 8.', '2004-10-07 04:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
