(947549, 109842, 5746, '<td valign="top">I wish you choosed different part (a nose, a wing, a tail, a tailpipe) or use different angle. Now, it''s more like the whole plane to me, not it''s part :( And the cockpit without pilot is "incomplete). 6.</td>', 'I wish you choosed different part (a nose, a wing, a tail, a tailpipe) or use different angle. Now, it''s more like the whole plane to me, not it''s part :( And the cockpit without pilot is "incomplete). 6.', '2004-10-07 04:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
