(947563, 110424, 25906, '<td valign="top">Hi~ I came back to change my score from 5 to 6 I think this photo would be alot better if the dark part in the bottom left hand corner was not there...IMO <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hi~ I came back to change my score from 5 to 6 I think this photo would be alot better if the dark part in the bottom left hand corner was not there...IMO Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-07 04:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
