(949023, 110183, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really great photograph! I like the tone and angle of view, the focus is sharp. Like how the roof tiles appear to move when I scroll it for viewing. Fantastic lighting/shadows. The only thing I would have liked to see done differently, maybe, is to crop out the top roof line. It stops my eyes, is jarring. Then again, I know that leaving it in is the only way I would be able to identify the subject. Very well done!</td>', 'A really great photograph! I like the tone and angle of view, the focus is sharp. Like how the roof tiles appear to move when I scroll it for viewing. Fantastic lighting/shadows. The only thing I would have liked to see done differently, maybe, is to crop out the top roof line. It stops my eyes, is jarring. Then again, I know that leaving it in is the only way I would be able to identify the subject. Very well done!', '2004-10-07 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(949032, 109419, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2004-10-07 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(949034, 109261, 19978, '<td valign="top">Even after viewing and voting on hundreds of shots in this challenge, this shot stopped me cold. My hat is off to you for having the vision to see the potential in this object and shoot it as well as you did. There are enough textures and shadows in this shot to spend  hours letting the eye wander across it and yet always finding something new and unexpected. I can''t think of a single recommendation that would improve upon your product. Kudos and good luck. 10.</td>', 'Even after viewing and voting on hundreds of shots in this challenge, this shot stopped me cold. My hat is off to you for having the vision to see the potential in this object and shoot it as well as you did. There are enough textures and shadows in this shot to spend  hours letting the eye wander across it and yet always finding something new and unexpected. I can''t think of a single recommendation that would improve upon your product. Kudos and good luck. 10.', '2004-10-07 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
