(949225, 110235, 18197, '<td valign="top">This started out a 5 in my preliminary voting and after successive views got bumped 1 by 1 to a 10. I love the simplicity of the photo. The composition is perfect. Focus and DOF are spot on. Colors are fantastic. This feels like a ribbon winner to me. Congratulations.</td>', 'This started out a 5 in my preliminary voting and after successive views got bumped 1 by 1 to a 10. I love the simplicity of the photo. The composition is perfect. Focus and DOF are spot on. Colors are fantastic. This feels like a ribbon winner to me. Congratulations.', '2004-10-07 22:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(949227, 108655, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/> <br/>Very nice tone and a wonderful pose but since you named it hands, I would have hid the nipple because it rather then the hands dominate. Of course,  one can argue that we are talking parts, part of the torso, part of the thigh, part of the arms etc. And while it may be a tongie in cheek, the poiny may be missed.</td>', 'returning for comments Very nice tone and a wonderful pose but since you named it hands, I would have hid the nipple because it rather then the hands dominate. Of course,  one can argue that we are talking parts, part of the torso, part of the thigh, part of the arms etc. And while it may be a tongie in cheek, the poiny may be missed.', '2004-10-07 22:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(949229, 109384, 18197, '<td valign="top">The most disturbing photo of the challenge. You have captured and transmitted the emotional agony of the animal and the emotional agony we should feel over the senseless slaughter of animals. The photo is very busy. However, the chaotic busy-ness of it contributes to the sense of chaos so I guess it works in this case.  There are some jpeg artifacts but it is probably due to the busy-ness and the failure of jpeg to compress a busy image very well. Congratulations on a great photo.</td>', 'The most disturbing photo of the challenge. You have captured and transmitted the emotional agony of the animal and the emotional agony we should feel over the senseless slaughter of animals. The photo is very busy. However, the chaotic busy-ness of it contributes to the sense of chaos so I guess it works in this case.  There are some jpeg artifacts but it is probably due to the busy-ness and the failure of jpeg to compress a busy image very well. Congratulations on a great photo.', '2004-10-07 22:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(949230, 110377, 18799, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!</td>', 'Hahaha!', '2004-10-07 22:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(949233, 110263, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Well composed and captured. IMO it is a bit too bright and would benefit from slightly greater contrast, but as-is, it''s among my top 5. Congratulations. This could well ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Well composed and captured. IMO it is a bit too bright and would benefit from slightly greater contrast, but as-is, it''s among my top 5. Congratulations. This could well ribbon.', '2004-10-07 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(949234, 110508, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/> <br/>Very impressive with lovely color tones and neat composition.</td>', 'returning for comments Very impressive with lovely color tones and neat composition.', '2004-10-07 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(949237, 110315, 18197, '<td valign="top">I looked at this, and looked, and looked. I was about to request a DQ and saw that it had been validated. What a fantastic capture. I hope you''ll tell us how you did it! Among my top 5.</td>', 'I looked at this, and looked, and looked. I was about to request a DQ and saw that it had been validated. What a fantastic capture. I hope you''ll tell us how you did it! Among my top 5.', '2004-10-07 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(949242, 109200, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love this abstract image. Colors and textures work exceptionaly well together. Composition may be the best in the challenge. Among my top 5 picks.</td>', 'Love this abstract image. Colors and textures work exceptionaly well together. Composition may be the best in the challenge. Among my top 5 picks.', '2004-10-07 22:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(949243, 110177, 18197, '<td valign="top">I assume you intended the soft focus and blown highlights, but it doesn''t resonate with me. Also, the highly saturated color hurts my teeth.  Sorry iof this seems negative. It''s just how I react to it.</td>', 'I assume you intended the soft focus and blown highlights, but it doesn''t resonate with me. Also, the highly saturated color hurts my teeth.  Sorry iof this seems negative. It''s just how I react to it.', '2004-10-07 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(949247, 109041, 18197, '<td valign="top">I initially gave this a pass based on thumbnail skimming. However, when I opened it ... it was a "wow" photo. I love the pixelated style. Unusual, but not so avant guard as to be jarring. Intense emotionally. Colors are fantastic. Composition is spot on. In fact all the technicals are right. Congratulations. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I initially gave this a pass based on thumbnail skimming. However, when I opened it ... it was a "wow" photo. I love the pixelated style. Unusual, but not so avant guard as to be jarring. Intense emotionally. Colors are fantastic. Composition is spot on. In fact all the technicals are right. Congratulations. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-07 22:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(949248, 109490, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly focused. Terrific color. All technicalities are well above professional grade. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Brilliantly focused. Terrific color. All technicalities are well above professional grade. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-07 23:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(949249, 109497, 18197, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail grabbed my attention and the photo didn''t let me down. Well conceived and executed. Among my top picks.</td>', 'The thumbnail grabbed my attention and the photo didn''t let me down. Well conceived and executed. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-07 23:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(949462, 110265, 25946, '<td valign="top">Flowers are my favorite subjects to photograph.  This is just so so beautiful. I love the colors and the little water drops.  Good Luck</td>', 'Flowers are my favorite subjects to photograph.  This is just so so beautiful. I love the colors and the little water drops.  Good Luck', '2004-10-08 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
