(949805, 109669, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the composition a lot!  But I have two big complaints. First, the lighting is bad. It''s flat and harsh, probably an on-camera flash (YUCK!).  Second, it has bad focus.  Notice on the right side of the cat  its hair is in sharp focus but its face is blurry.</td>', 'Cute. I like the composition a lot!  But I have two big complaints. First, the lighting is bad. It''s flat and harsh, probably an on-camera flash (YUCK!).  Second, it has bad focus.  Notice on the right side of the cat  its hair is in sharp focus but its face is blurry.', '2004-10-08 01:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(949813, 109493, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!! Fabulous colors and lighting. I love it! 9.</td>', 'Wow!!!! Fabulous colors and lighting. I love it! 9.', '2004-10-08 02:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
