(949820, 110315, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I think I''ve seen an almost identical image somewhere before, maybe it''s one of yours done in a similar style. Great lighting, the red highlights are cool. Nice sharp image. 9</td>', 'Awesome! I think I''ve seen an almost identical image somewhere before, maybe it''s one of yours done in a similar style. Great lighting, the red highlights are cool. Nice sharp image. 9', '2004-10-08 02:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
