(950254, 110131, 9073, '<td valign="top">The idea of using textured glass in a photo is very nice. However, I think you needed to prepare your final vision a bit better. In other words, the texture conflicts with the flower shapes rather than adds a painted feeling. As a suggestion, you could try moving the flowers further away from a less thick pane and focus on the flowers using a very limited dof. That should help reduce, yet retain some of, the negative impact of the glass.</td>', 'The idea of using textured glass in a photo is very nice. However, I think you needed to prepare your final vision a bit better. In other words, the texture conflicts with the flower shapes rather than adds a painted feeling. As a suggestion, you could try moving the flowers further away from a less thick pane and focus on the flowers using a very limited dof. That should help reduce, yet retain some of, the negative impact of the glass.', '2004-10-08 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(950259, 109498, 9073, '<td valign="top">Lovely sentiment here.</td>', 'Lovely sentiment here.', '2004-10-08 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
