(950272, 109200, 26526, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photograph. I love the lines in it, the curves. Stunning color use. Excellent lighting and focus. So simple, yet so elegant.  Very fitting title. Gets a 10 from me!</td>', 'A beautiful photograph. I love the lines in it, the curves. Stunning color use. Excellent lighting and focus. So simple, yet so elegant.  Very fitting title. Gets a 10 from me!', '2004-10-08 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
