(950291, 110411, 26526, '<td valign="top">A favorite photograph of mine in this contest. Fits the challenge. Beautiful color, the texture is astounding. Looks like a needle point tapestry. Possibly the only thing I would like to see changed, is the left bottom corner, sharper focus to match the remaining print. No advice on how to achieve this, my macro shots are not nearly this stunning! Very well done.</td>', 'A favorite photograph of mine in this contest. Fits the challenge. Beautiful color, the texture is astounding. Looks like a needle point tapestry. Possibly the only thing I would like to see changed, is the left bottom corner, sharper focus to match the remaining print. No advice on how to achieve this, my macro shots are not nearly this stunning! Very well done.', '2004-10-08 12:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
