(950496, 110061, 20771, '<td valign="top">could be more  sharperly in focus. Also needs noise removal.</td>', 'could be more  sharperly in focus. Also needs noise removal.', '2004-10-08 15:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(950505, 109346, 20771, '<td valign="top">For my taste you have hyped the color too much.</td>', 'For my taste you have hyped the color too much.', '2004-10-08 15:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(950513, 110556, 27586, '<td valign="top">I like this image as its sharp, clean and bright.</td>', 'I like this image as its sharp, clean and bright.', '2004-10-08 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(950524, 109833, 20779, '<td valign="top">This just screams "classic". I don''t whether you just stumbled on the opportunity and seized it or carefully set it up - either way, attests to great vision.</td>', 'This just screams "classic". I don''t whether you just stumbled on the opportunity and seized it or carefully set it up - either way, attests to great vision.', '2004-10-08 15:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(950525, 110162, 20779, '<td valign="top">A well done classic. Terrific colors and textures; great composition. The tilt just adds the right amount of interest.</td>', 'A well done classic. Terrific colors and textures; great composition. The tilt just adds the right amount of interest.', '2004-10-08 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(950527, 110356, 20779, '<td valign="top">What can I say? A masterful classic.</td>', 'What can I say? A masterful classic.', '2004-10-08 15:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(950528, 110515, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and engaging. Well chosen for the challenge and superb composition, colors and textures.</td>', 'Beautiful and engaging. Well chosen for the challenge and superb composition, colors and textures.', '2004-10-08 15:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(950531, 109513, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very emotive and well-composed. Your post-processing is excellent and done to just the right balance.</td>', 'Very emotive and well-composed. Your post-processing is excellent and done to just the right balance.', '2004-10-08 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(950532, 109356, 20779, '<td valign="top">The lighting, crisp colors and angle - all winners!</td>', 'The lighting, crisp colors and angle - all winners!', '2004-10-08 15:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(950534, 110428, 20779, '<td valign="top">The perfect composition and "part" of architecture composed and presented.</td>', 'The perfect composition and "part" of architecture composed and presented.', '2004-10-08 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(950537, 109346, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color and composition. The tendrils laying across the feather creates just the right amount of "interest" for the eye without obstructing the main subject. I like the fading focus as your eye travels uutward.</td>', 'Fantastic color and composition. The tendrils laying across the feather creates just the right amount of "interest" for the eye without obstructing the main subject. I like the fading focus as your eye travels uutward.', '2004-10-08 15:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(950541, 109406, 20779, '<td valign="top">Excellent study in color, detail and texture. I am glad to know I am not the only one who finds beauty and fascination in these old wood fences. Wonderful piece!</td>', 'Excellent study in color, detail and texture. I am glad to know I am not the only one who finds beauty and fascination in these old wood fences. Wonderful piece!', '2004-10-08 15:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(950546, 109381, 20779, '<td valign="top">Excellent, crisp detail; perfect DOF; great lighting and angle.</td>', 'Excellent, crisp detail; perfect DOF; great lighting and angle.', '2004-10-08 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(950550, 110504, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cool slice of life.</td>', 'Very cool slice of life.', '2004-10-08 15:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(950552, 110369, 20779, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing.</td>', 'Mesmerizing.', '2004-10-08 15:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(950554, 110360, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fascinating piece of nature study.</td>', 'Fascinating piece of nature study.', '2004-10-08 15:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(950556, 109134, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice background lighting. The coffee looks good. The highlight on the handle is a bit intense.</td>', 'Nice background lighting. The coffee looks good. The highlight on the handle is a bit intense.', '2004-10-08 15:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(950557, 110414, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I once tried this and didn''t do half as well with my vision for what I wanted.</td>', 'Great capture. I once tried this and didn''t do half as well with my vision for what I wanted.', '2004-10-08 15:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(950561, 109130, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great eye for choosing your subject and focus.</td>', 'Great eye for choosing your subject and focus.', '2004-10-08 15:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(950563, 109995, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, lighting and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, lighting and composition.', '2004-10-08 15:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(950566, 109672, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of digital art. This would make a great wall hanging.</td>', 'Wonderful use of digital art. This would make a great wall hanging.', '2004-10-08 15:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(950567, 110427, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very interesting point of view and geometric study.</td>', 'Very interesting point of view and geometric study.', '2004-10-08 15:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(950568, 110243, 20779, '<td valign="top">I don''t even want to know how you got this shot! Fantastic!</td>', 'I don''t even want to know how you got this shot! Fantastic!', '2004-10-08 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(950569, 110244, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition and interesting to the eye.</td>', 'Very cool composition and interesting to the eye.', '2004-10-08 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(950571, 109384, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing subject. It has a washed out appearence. I find there is a bit too much competetition between the textural detail of the fur and the gras and dry leaves. Perhaps a very low angle of view would have enhanced the drama of the subject?</td>', 'Very disturbing subject. It has a washed out appearence. I find there is a bit too much competetition between the textural detail of the fur and the gras and dry leaves. Perhaps a very low angle of view would have enhanced the drama of the subject?', '2004-10-08 15:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(950572, 110060, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love this perspecitive and crop. Very engaging to the eye. Nice and smooth, too.</td>', 'Love this perspecitive and crop. Very engaging to the eye. Nice and smooth, too.', '2004-10-08 15:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(950577, 110418, 20779, '<td valign="top">This just lights up my desk. Beautiful capture and choice of angles.</td>', 'This just lights up my desk. Beautiful capture and choice of angles.', '2004-10-08 15:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(950579, 110116, 20779, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC shot. Love to know the post-processing done or not done. Very, very cool shot.</td>', 'FANTASTIC shot. Love to know the post-processing done or not done. Very, very cool shot.', '2004-10-08 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(950580, 109909, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cool industrial shot. I like the smoothness used.</td>', 'Very cool industrial shot. I like the smoothness used.', '2004-10-08 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(950581, 110292, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast image. The connection to the challenge seems rather tenuous. Quite a bit of the tree is in the shot. There really isn''t much left out to give the viewer a strong impression that he is only seeing part of the tree.</td>', 'Nice high contrast image. The connection to the challenge seems rather tenuous. Quite a bit of the tree is in the shot. There really isn''t much left out to give the viewer a strong impression that he is only seeing part of the tree.', '2004-10-08 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(950582, 110340, 20779, '<td valign="top">Enchanting shot and very creative choice.</td>', 'Enchanting shot and very creative choice.', '2004-10-08 15:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(950584, 109493, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, soft filtered effect. Splendid composition.</td>', 'Beautiful, soft filtered effect. Splendid composition.', '2004-10-08 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(950585, 109200, 20779, '<td valign="top">Extremely well-composed.</td>', 'Extremely well-composed.', '2004-10-08 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(950587, 110183, 20779, '<td valign="top">Terrific repetition. I would love to see a version "2" with the top edge cropped with just the tiles showing and see what that looks like, also. Good job!! Crisp lines, great lighting.</td>', 'Terrific repetition. I would love to see a version "2" with the top edge cropped with just the tiles showing and see what that looks like, also. Good job!! Crisp lines, great lighting.', '2004-10-08 16:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(950588, 110331, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great mood set and perfect composition within the frame.</td>', 'Great mood set and perfect composition within the frame.', '2004-10-08 16:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(950589, 110366, 7322, '<td valign="top">You''ve met the challenge and shown a part of something. I don''t find that it was done in a very compelling way, however. This composition appears random and unthought out to me. There is nothing in this composition to hold my interest in terms of subject matter. As an abstract, it fails to appeal to me, also. The lines, shape, and color don''t create enough visual harmony or dynamic interest for me.</td>', 'You''ve met the challenge and shown a part of something. I don''t find that it was done in a very compelling way, however. This composition appears random and unthought out to me. There is nothing in this composition to hold my interest in terms of subject matter. As an abstract, it fails to appeal to me, also. The lines, shape, and color don''t create enough visual harmony or dynamic interest for me.', '2004-10-08 16:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(950596, 109815, 6532, '<td valign="top">My top pick in this challenge and a new favorite.  Those contrasting colors get me every time.  Wonderful clarity!</td>', 'My top pick in this challenge and a new favorite.  Those contrasting colors get me every time.  Wonderful clarity!', '2004-10-08 16:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(950599, 108643, 6532, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what this is... kinda small and a bit dark.</td>', 'Can''t really tell what this is... kinda small and a bit dark.', '2004-10-08 16:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(950600, 108661, 6532, '<td valign="top">Did you plan for this one to be this way, as far as the white on the left side?</td>', 'Did you plan for this one to be this way, as far as the white on the left side?', '2004-10-08 16:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(950609, 109472, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think this could make a great poster, nicely done, the richness of the blue light is superbly portrayed.</td>', 'I think this could make a great poster, nicely done, the richness of the blue light is superbly portrayed.', '2004-10-08 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(950610, 108855, 11897, '<td valign="top">Excellent closeup.</td>', 'Excellent closeup.', '2004-10-08 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(950612, 110136, 27771, '<td valign="top">good technique, good clarity, but perhaps a bit too ordinary to be interesting</td>', 'good technique, good clarity, but perhaps a bit too ordinary to be interesting', '2004-10-08 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(950614, 109271, 27771, '<td valign="top">I like the dana design sticker on the front bumper, this is interesting as an AP shot reporting on the Hurricane.  Would go well in a documentary, but maybe doesn''t seem to related to "Parts."  Interesting image though</td>', 'I like the dana design sticker on the front bumper, this is interesting as an AP shot reporting on the Hurricane.  Would go well in a documentary, but maybe doesn''t seem to related to "Parts."  Interesting image though', '2004-10-08 16:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(950615, 108973, 27771, '<td valign="top">well-taken photo, did you use a blue spot?  good use of f-stop on subject matter closest to the lense, the lines seem to lead all around the object, so my eyes sort of wander, very well taken</td>', 'well-taken photo, did you use a blue spot?  good use of f-stop on subject matter closest to the lense, the lines seem to lead all around the object, so my eyes sort of wander, very well taken', '2004-10-08 16:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(950616, 108972, 11897, '<td valign="top">The trees are slightly distracting, interesting subject, if I may suggest a slightly different angle to avoid the trees, and a fill in flash could allow less exposure for the sky. portrait format may help. 5</td>', 'The trees are slightly distracting, interesting subject, if I may suggest a slightly different angle to avoid the trees, and a fill in flash could allow less exposure for the sky. portrait format may help. 5', '2004-10-08 16:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(950617, 110346, 27771, '<td valign="top">this is a really good shot.  I like the angle, I like the darkness, the lighting is really good (natural light?) the round object on the left is an interesting focal point and it makes me want to explore around a bit.  Good color, did you adjust these levels at all?  It looks very natural.</td>', 'this is a really good shot.  I like the angle, I like the darkness, the lighting is really good (natural light?) the round object on the left is an interesting focal point and it makes me want to explore around a bit.  Good color, did you adjust these levels at all?  It looks very natural.', '2004-10-08 16:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(950618, 110132, 11897, '<td valign="top">interesting subject but the focus is a little out,</td>', 'interesting subject but the focus is a little out,', '2004-10-08 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(950620, 109364, 27771, '<td valign="top">a little too busy, maybe you could focus in on a piece of the subject for a more interesting effect.</td>', 'a little too busy, maybe you could focus in on a piece of the subject for a more interesting effect.', '2004-10-08 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(950622, 108947, 27771, '<td valign="top">very good shot.  Nice attention to detail and good match of color with lighting.  I think you spotted a nice pattern and set up the right framing and everything.  Any post production done here?  color levels or contrast changes?  Looks really nice</td>', 'very good shot.  Nice attention to detail and good match of color with lighting.  I think you spotted a nice pattern and set up the right framing and everything.  Any post production done here?  color levels or contrast changes?  Looks really nice', '2004-10-08 16:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(950625, 109631, 11897, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality, maybe a little disjointed with two items placed as you have them.</td>', 'Excellent quality, maybe a little disjointed with two items placed as you have them.', '2004-10-08 16:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(950627, 109228, 27771, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful image with some beautiful colors.  I think there may be too much going on in the image though.  There seem to be three separate focal points, the lamp, the fence and the sunset.  Any one of these could be really interesting as its own ''part.''  I''d like to see one focused on the lamp with a blurry pink sunset background perhaps.</td>', 'this is a beautiful image with some beautiful colors.  I think there may be too much going on in the image though.  There seem to be three separate focal points, the lamp, the fence and the sunset.  Any one of these could be really interesting as its own ''part.''  I''d like to see one focused on the lamp with a blurry pink sunset background perhaps.', '2004-10-08 16:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(950629, 109426, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, maybe a little more saturation of the blues, 6</td>', 'Nice angle, maybe a little more saturation of the blues, 6', '2004-10-08 16:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(950630, 109992, 11897, '<td valign="top">very good detail, nice dof 8</td>', 'very good detail, nice dof 8', '2004-10-08 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(950632, 110011, 27771, '<td valign="top">you did a good job with your lighting here as it came out with a comic book, kind of magazine ad feel.  It looks really good and really professional like it was done in a studio.  how did you do the background?  what was your lighting setup?</td>', 'you did a good job with your lighting here as it came out with a comic book, kind of magazine ad feel.  It looks really good and really professional like it was done in a studio.  how did you do the background?  what was your lighting setup?', '2004-10-08 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(950633, 110479, 11897, '<td valign="top">I am not keen on "pet" pictures but this is different, nicely thought out and portrayed. 8</td>', 'I am not keen on "pet" pictures but this is different, nicely thought out and portrayed. 8', '2004-10-08 16:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(950634, 109750, 11897, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done.</td>', 'Cleverly done.', '2004-10-08 16:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(950635, 109586, 27771, '<td valign="top">a bit too grainy, a very difficult shot to take, try when there is some natural daylight would be my suggestion, even partial daylight to give a soft blue hue behind the wires</td>', 'a bit too grainy, a very difficult shot to take, try when there is some natural daylight would be my suggestion, even partial daylight to give a soft blue hue behind the wires', '2004-10-08 16:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(950636, 110418, 11897, '<td valign="top">Love the definition and the vibrant colours 8</td>', 'Love the definition and the vibrant colours 8', '2004-10-08 16:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(950637, 110419, 27771, '<td valign="top">doesn''t have the sharp clarity that it needs but the wood grain behind it looks good, maybe you could crop the white out of the bottom and focus in on the bits</td>', 'doesn''t have the sharp clarity that it needs but the wood grain behind it looks good, maybe you could crop the white out of the bottom and focus in on the bits', '2004-10-08 16:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(950640, 109261, 27771, '<td valign="top">very interesting subject, good lighting, the shadows do very well with the carvings and bring out the best effect here.  Lighting and color are very well done as is your angle.  Straight on effect does not distract from the subject, which is your strength here.  Nice job.</td>', 'very interesting subject, good lighting, the shadows do very well with the carvings and bring out the best effect here.  Lighting and color are very well done as is your angle.  Straight on effect does not distract from the subject, which is your strength here.  Nice job.', '2004-10-08 16:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(950641, 109812, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice job.7</td>', 'Nice job.7', '2004-10-08 16:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(950642, 109342, 27771, '<td valign="top">this one is very playful, but unusual and difficult to capture.  Your soft edging does it really well.  Lighting is not too harsh and its very pleasing to the eye.  A very difficult image to make interesting.  I think you did a good job</td>', 'this one is very playful, but unusual and difficult to capture.  Your soft edging does it really well.  Lighting is not too harsh and its very pleasing to the eye.  A very difficult image to make interesting.  I think you did a good job', '2004-10-08 16:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(950643, 110361, 27771, '<td valign="top">a studio piece, looks like a photo from Institue of Art.  You did a good job with the still life and caught most of the interest of the piece without cramming too much in.  Your lighting is very natural, not too harsh, but with enough fill to clearly explore the image.  Looks really good.</td>', 'a studio piece, looks like a photo from Institue of Art.  You did a good job with the still life and caught most of the interest of the piece without cramming too much in.  Your lighting is very natural, not too harsh, but with enough fill to clearly explore the image.  Looks really good.', '2004-10-08 16:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(950644, 110515, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think the one on the top left distracts slightly from a very nice, colourful picture 7</td>', 'I think the one on the top left distracts slightly from a very nice, colourful picture 7', '2004-10-08 16:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(950645, 110263, 27771, '<td valign="top">this image is nice, good color, nice soft light, good cropping...very interesting image</td>', 'this image is nice, good color, nice soft light, good cropping...very interesting image', '2004-10-08 16:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
