(950649, 110326, 27771, '<td valign="top">nice job, colors look good with the gray surface, a nice contrast.  the tops of the sticks seem a *little* blurred, but it is still very interesting. good depth of field</td>', 'nice job, colors look good with the gray surface, a nice contrast.  the tops of the sticks seem a *little* blurred, but it is still very interesting. good depth of field', '2004-10-08 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
