(950775, 109758, 24511, '<td valign="top">I have the toughest time trying to capture dim lighted subjects.  I love the color with a hint of yellow eclipse.  Your moon knuckle photo is very well crafted being off center and thus in a area of interest.  The spiked points of red vanishing in the dark background create an awsome shape.  I was going to skip this one but now it seems kind of romantic like cudling in front of a full moon. Thanks for my 1st ten this challenge.</td>', 'I have the toughest time trying to capture dim lighted subjects.  I love the color with a hint of yellow eclipse.  Your moon knuckle photo is very well crafted being off center and thus in a area of interest.  The spiked points of red vanishing in the dark background create an awsome shape.  I was going to skip this one but now it seems kind of romantic like cudling in front of a full moon. Thanks for my 1st ten this challenge.', '2004-10-08 17:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(950777, 110500, 22970, '<td valign="top">1.	Great micro<br/>2.	Great focus<br/>3.	Love the colors<br/>4.	Background on left [light part] a little distracting<br/>5.	Great photograph</td>', '1.	Great micro2.	Great focus3.	Love the colors4.	Background on left [light part] a little distracting5.	Great photograph', '2004-10-08 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
