(951867, 110362, 25486, '<td valign="top">Some nice deep blacks but the main tyre is a bit burnt out and there''s a distraction in the bottom left.  I may be wrong but it would seem that you had time to frame it better?  Nice subject matter and the B&amp;W works well.  Very good.</td>', 'Some nice deep blacks but the main tyre is a bit burnt out and there''s a distraction in the bottom left.  I may be wrong but it would seem that you had time to frame it better?  Nice subject matter and the B&W works well.  Very good.', '2004-10-09 14:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(951868, 109178, 25486, '<td valign="top">The colours are great and the detail and texture on the "plug" are shown very nicely.  The background is blurred nicely but the white object is very distracting.  A different angle could have removed it altogether.</td>', 'The colours are great and the detail and texture on the "plug" are shown very nicely.  The background is blurred nicely but the white object is very distracting.  A different angle could have removed it altogether.', '2004-10-09 14:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
