(951876, 110520, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like the way this image shows the parts, very clever.  It may not do so well in the challenge, (I hope it does), but it shows a different interpretation.</td>', 'I like the way this image shows the parts, very clever.  It may not do so well in the challenge, (I hope it does), but it shows a different interpretation.', '2004-10-09 14:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(951877, 109426, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great contrast in colors.  The rust looks great against the blue sky.  The composition is wonderful as well.  Love how the wing leads you across the photo.  The clouds add nice detail.  I especially like that the scene looks natural as well, no oversaturation of colors or dodging or burning of the sky.  Very Nice!  Bumped to a 9</td>', 'Great contrast in colors.  The rust looks great against the blue sky.  The composition is wonderful as well.  Love how the wing leads you across the photo.  The clouds add nice detail.  I especially like that the scene looks natural as well, no oversaturation of colors or dodging or burning of the sky.  Very Nice!  Bumped to a 9', '2004-10-09 14:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(951878, 110466, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W study, shame about the distraction of the building below the knee.</td>', 'Nice B&W study, shame about the distraction of the building below the knee.', '2004-10-09 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(951882, 109833, 14620, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!!!  Love the scene you have set.  I especially like the lines of the photograph.  Really adds impact to the shot.  Quite nice.</td>', 'Excellent composition!!!  Love the scene you have set.  I especially like the lines of the photograph.  Really adds impact to the shot.  Quite nice.', '2004-10-09 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
