(952166, 110453, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''m still looking for a great guitar to add to my favorites collection.  I love the upper frames distant fading into darkness and the sunburst reds and yellows of the wood surface.  The blurred high note frets was less appealing to me.  My love for music bumps you up to an 8.  Thanks.</td>', 'I''m still looking for a great guitar to add to my favorites collection.  I love the upper frames distant fading into darkness and the sunburst reds and yellows of the wood surface.  The blurred high note frets was less appealing to me.  My love for music bumps you up to an 8.  Thanks.', '2004-10-09 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
