(952182, 110118, 24511, '<td valign="top">Title reminds me of number crunching while sizing digital images for DPChallenge.  I liked the reflection and lighting.  The lines and holes taken at an angle created to my surprise little depth.  I wonder if the expanded wishbone/sling shot pipe makes the illusion of the smaller holes to be wider.  Thanks for the optical teaser.</td>', 'Title reminds me of number crunching while sizing digital images for DPChallenge.  I liked the reflection and lighting.  The lines and holes taken at an angle created to my surprise little depth.  I wonder if the expanded wishbone/sling shot pipe makes the illusion of the smaller holes to be wider.  Thanks for the optical teaser.', '2004-10-09 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
