(952958, 109776, 26757, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good cropping and placement in the frame, great as a stock image.<br/>ginette</td>', 'Very nice.  Good cropping and placement in the frame, great as a stock image.ginette', '2004-10-10 15:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
