(952960, 110331, 26757, '<td valign="top">Could be very intewresting, but IMHO it is too dark and therefore you''ve lost the detail in the shadows.  The overall tone needs attention as well.<br/>ginette</td>', 'Could be very intewresting, but IMHO it is too dark and therefore you''ve lost the detail in the shadows.  The overall tone needs attention as well.ginette', '2004-10-10 15:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
