(952982, 109833, 26757, '<td valign="top">Very, Very nice.  Great reflection, focus, subject and composition.  I like that you chose a long depth of field.  I like the repetition of vertical lines and the background diagonals.  Nice tonal range.<br/>ginette</td>', 'Very, Very nice.  Great reflection, focus, subject and composition.  I like that you chose a long depth of field.  I like the repetition of vertical lines and the background diagonals.  Nice tonal range.ginette', '2004-10-10 16:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
