(954098, 109841, 27702, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and no filters. Thats really obvious. Good job! also the title is very inspired!</td>', 'Nice detail and no filters. Thats really obvious. Good job! also the title is very inspired!', '2004-10-11 08:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
