(954139, 108975, 24065, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite photo of the challenge and my only "10" -- I hope you explain how you did it after the challenge.</td>', 'This was my favorite photo of the challenge and my only "10" -- I hope you explain how you did it after the challenge.', '2004-10-11 10:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
