(954382, 110002, 23511, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  Looking at the photo makes me dizzy - if this was the effect you were going for, you did it!!  Quite well done. Would I put it on my wall?  No, but some other folks I know would, so, it may do well.  G''luck.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  Looking at the photo makes me dizzy - if this was the effect you were going for, you did it!!  Quite well done. Would I put it on my wall?  No, but some other folks I know would, so, it may do well.  G''luck.', '2004-10-11 13:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(954384, 110438, 23511, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  I feel like it might have been more effective if the eyes were more accentuated.<br/></td>', 'Meets the challenge.  I feel like it might have been more effective if the eyes were more accentuated.', '2004-10-11 13:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(954387, 110128, 23511, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, it meets the challenge in that this is part of the whole animal, but it lacks WOW! - yet I''m not sure how this photo could have been improved.</td>', 'I like the subject, it meets the challenge in that this is part of the whole animal, but it lacks WOW! - yet I''m not sure how this photo could have been improved.', '2004-10-11 13:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(954390, 109815, 23511, '<td valign="top">Well done photo, and it does meet the challenge.  It lacks WOW, however.  Did you have the opportunity to catch the top of the larger dome and omit the smaller - or vice-versa?</td>', 'Well done photo, and it does meet the challenge.  It lacks WOW, however.  Did you have the opportunity to catch the top of the larger dome and omit the smaller - or vice-versa?', '2004-10-11 13:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(954393, 108792, 23511, '<td valign="top">This could work as an advertisement - like in a fabric or craft shop.  Good idea and nice, clear shot.  Probably a matte of preference, but I''d be interested in seeing this with more saturated colors or more contrast.</td>', 'This could work as an advertisement - like in a fabric or craft shop.  Good idea and nice, clear shot.  Probably a matte of preference, but I''d be interested in seeing this with more saturated colors or more contrast.', '2004-10-11 13:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(954396, 109041, 23511, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy texture - this looks like a painting - what did you do to make this effect?  I think the forehead being so light takes away from it.  The color of your eyes (assuming the other is the same)  is wonderful.</td>', 'I like the grainy texture - this looks like a painting - what did you do to make this effect?  I think the forehead being so light takes away from it.  The color of your eyes (assuming the other is the same)  is wonderful.', '2004-10-11 13:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(954405, 110508, 23511, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  This might work on the wall in a kid''s room or as an advertisement for kids-something.  I like the idea, something makes it lack WOW (can''t decide what), but it is solid, otherwise.</td>', 'Hmmm.  This might work on the wall in a kid''s room or as an advertisement for kids-something.  I like the idea, something makes it lack WOW (can''t decide what), but it is solid, otherwise.', '2004-10-11 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
