(954705, 109365, 25873, '<td valign="top">Nice wheels :-)<br/> <br/>It was probably intentional to use a shallower DOF, and I think that''s fine.  However, I feel that the part that is out of focus (the rubber tire) is the most dominant part of the picture, so it overwhelms the focus in the middle of the picture instead of accentuating it.</td>', 'Nice wheels :-) It was probably intentional to use a shallower DOF, and I think that''s fine.  However, I feel that the part that is out of focus (the rubber tire) is the most dominant part of the picture, so it overwhelms the focus in the middle of the picture instead of accentuating it.', '2004-10-11 17:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(954709, 108794, 25873, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  As a matter of personal preference I don''t like the soft focus - maybe because tennis doesn''t really seem like something with a soft/emotional side, which is what I like in soft focus.</td>', 'Cool shot.  As a matter of personal preference I don''t like the soft focus - maybe because tennis doesn''t really seem like something with a soft/emotional side, which is what I like in soft focus.', '2004-10-11 17:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
