(955548, 110356, 1827, '<td valign="top">I think sepia is a good idea for this photo; I just don''t care for the tones used to create this sepia -- seems too green.  That said, if the green quality weren''t distracting me the wheel provokes enough interest to keep me looking.  The composition is also quite good. 6</td>', 'I think sepia is a good idea for this photo; I just don''t care for the tones used to create this sepia -- seems too green.  That said, if the green quality weren''t distracting me the wheel provokes enough interest to keep me looking.  The composition is also quite good. 6', '2004-10-12 10:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(955550, 109964, 1827, '<td valign="top">I love baby parts, but I feel the lighting is too harsh here for such a delicate subject.  I do love how much detail you''ve captured down to the peachfuzz.  Congratulations, s/he looks quite new. 6</td>', 'I love baby parts, but I feel the lighting is too harsh here for such a delicate subject.  I do love how much detail you''ve captured down to the peachfuzz.  Congratulations, s/he looks quite new. 6', '2004-10-12 10:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(955556, 110151, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would look better if you had exposed a bit shorter, like 1/2 a stop or even 1 stop but great shot, good sharpness.</td>', 'I think this shot would look better if you had exposed a bit shorter, like 1/2 a stop or even 1 stop but great shot, good sharpness.', '2004-10-12 10:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
