(955778, 110252, 20115, '<td valign="top">Need a sharper focus.</td>', 'Need a sharper focus.', '2004-10-12 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(955792, 108739, 18197, '<td valign="top">The border turns me off a bit. It''s well balanced enough, like a good mat, but the photo edges are a bit cliched. Against the stark white, the body of the photo looks dim by comparison. The diagonal composition is the trickiest composition for me and I have a lot of trouble making it work. In this case, it doesn''t help highlight the subject very well. Sorry to seem negative. I''m relatively new to this so these are just my opinions.</td>', 'The border turns me off a bit. It''s well balanced enough, like a good mat, but the photo edges are a bit cliched. Against the stark white, the body of the photo looks dim by comparison. The diagonal composition is the trickiest composition for me and I have a lot of trouble making it work. In this case, it doesn''t help highlight the subject very well. Sorry to seem negative. I''m relatively new to this so these are just my opinions.', '2004-10-12 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(955798, 108671, 18197, '<td valign="top">Focus is such an important thing with eyes. IMO they need to be in very sharp focus. There is really nothing here that is in sharp focus. And with eyes, highlights are very important. The eyes here are dark with just a hint of highlight. If you could punch up the highlights a bit, it would improve my reaction to the photo. Sorry to seem negative. I''m relatively new at this and these are just my opinions.</td>', 'Focus is such an important thing with eyes. IMO they need to be in very sharp focus. There is really nothing here that is in sharp focus. And with eyes, highlights are very important. The eyes here are dark with just a hint of highlight. If you could punch up the highlights a bit, it would improve my reaction to the photo. Sorry to seem negative. I''m relatively new at this and these are just my opinions.', '2004-10-12 14:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(955803, 109194, 18197, '<td valign="top">It''s probably my failure but I don''t resonate with this. The partial words at the bottom of the photo are distracting. The color shift from the bottom 1/3 to the top 2/3 thirds is confusing. I am looking at part of a camera and part of a person, so I guess it meets the challenge, but I''m not sure what you''re trying to convey. Your title adds to the confusion. I guess I''m just lost here, sorry.</td>', 'It''s probably my failure but I don''t resonate with this. The partial words at the bottom of the photo are distracting. The color shift from the bottom 1/3 to the top 2/3 thirds is confusing. I am looking at part of a camera and part of a person, so I guess it meets the challenge, but I''m not sure what you''re trying to convey. Your title adds to the confusion. I guess I''m just lost here, sorry.', '2004-10-12 14:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(955808, 110569, 16965, '<td valign="top">cool looking part!!</td>', 'cool looking part!!', '2004-10-12 14:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
