(955812, 109392, 18197, '<td valign="top">I suspect no photo of a dictionary definition will ever do well here unless there is something else going on. In this case, I see the disctionary page as "part" of the frame. Add points for creativity. The words (and the page itself) look flat.  Not enough here to hold my interest (deduct points). And the title is confusing (deduct points). I''m relatively new at this so these are just opinions. Sorry to seem negative.</td>', 'I suspect no photo of a dictionary definition will ever do well here unless there is something else going on. In this case, I see the disctionary page as "part" of the frame. Add points for creativity. The words (and the page itself) look flat.  Not enough here to hold my interest (deduct points). And the title is confusing (deduct points). I''m relatively new at this so these are just opinions. Sorry to seem negative.', '2004-10-12 14:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(955815, 108693, 18197, '<td valign="top">There is a certain drama here. The (oversaturated) red is in sharp contrast to the black and white of the tire. Composition is fine. It has a grittiness I like, in small doses. Focus could use a little work and I think I would like it better if the ground wasn''t quite so blown out.</td>', 'There is a certain drama here. The (oversaturated) red is in sharp contrast to the black and white of the tire. Composition is fine. It has a grittiness I like, in small doses. Focus could use a little work and I think I would like it better if the ground wasn''t quite so blown out.', '2004-10-12 14:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
