(956743, 109950, 23956, '<td valign="top">I expected this shot to be much higher on the list. Well, I still say it''s a ten. I love this perspective, and the exposure is perfect.</td>', 'I expected this shot to be much higher on the list. Well, I still say it''s a ten. I love this perspective, and the exposure is perfect.', '2004-10-13 01:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
