(956758, 109394, 8891, '<td valign="top">Big congrats on your top ten finish, Kylie! Great shot. And purple! Perfect!</td>', 'Big congrats on your top ten finish, Kylie! Great shot. And purple! Perfect!', '2004-10-13 01:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
