(956760, 110263, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your5th finish with this delicately colorful entry with texture one can feel.</td>', 'Congratulations on your5th finish with this delicately colorful entry with texture one can feel.', '2004-10-13 01:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(956763, 110315, 25946, '<td valign="top">WOW  another ribbon.  That is just terrific.  I thought this was just an amazing shot, loved it the first time I saw it.  10.. Congratulations</td>', 'WOW  another ribbon.  That is just terrific.  I thought this was just an amazing shot, loved it the first time I saw it.  10.. Congratulations', '2004-10-13 01:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(956764, 109394, 22734, '<td valign="top">Kylie: I can not tell you how impressed I am with this winner entry and in top ten to boot. Way to go!</td>', 'Kylie: I can not tell you how impressed I am with this winner entry and in top ten to boot. Way to go!', '2004-10-13 01:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(956765, 110504, 25873, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments during the challenge.  There were so many entries, it was nice to get any feedback at all.<br/> <br/>In response to the preference that the full door was visible - I agree, however, if I were to do that it would have exposed a lot of scratches and scuffs on the door frame that I found distracting.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments during the challenge.  There were so many entries, it was nice to get any feedback at all. In response to the preference that the full door was visible - I agree, however, if I were to do that it would have exposed a lot of scratches and scuffs on the door frame that I found distracting.', '2004-10-13 01:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(956767, 110002, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 7th finish with this bristling image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 7th finish with this bristling image.', '2004-10-13 01:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(956769, 109135, 27375, '<td valign="top">i really liked this, i gave it a 9, i think it should have done better<br/>just because it not perfect or something i dont know. i like things with flaws better, and the quality of the picture is just great</td>', 'i really liked this, i gave it a 9, i think it should have done betterjust because it not perfect or something i dont know. i like things with flaws better, and the quality of the picture is just great', '2004-10-13 01:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(956776, 109870, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s obvious that some folks just didn''t know how hard this image was to get.  The water droplets tell that the focus was as sharp as it could be.  The water was moving around quite a bit on you, and it must have indeed been a choppy ride.  <br/> <br/>Wonder did you protect that Canon 300D in the boat?<br/> <br/>Keep up the good shooting.</td>', 'Well, it''s obvious that some folks just didn''t know how hard this image was to get.  The water droplets tell that the focus was as sharp as it could be.  The water was moving around quite a bit on you, and it must have indeed been a choppy ride.   Wonder did you protect that Canon 300D in the boat? Keep up the good shooting.', '2004-10-13 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
