(957102, 109955, 9809, '<td valign="top">Congrats on where you placed ... I thought it should have done better. I disagree with most here in that the hind leg SHOULD be in the picture -- it helps me know the dog was all curled up. Without that piece of leg, we might think it were all stretched out in the sun or something. But hey, that''s my opinion -- clearly only one voice and you have to create a picture that gets most folks to vote favorably. Good luck on your next challenge.</td>', 'Congrats on where you placed ... I thought it should have done better. I disagree with most here in that the hind leg SHOULD be in the picture -- it helps me know the dog was all curled up. Without that piece of leg, we might think it were all stretched out in the sun or something. But hey, that''s my opinion -- clearly only one voice and you have to create a picture that gets most folks to vote favorably. Good luck on your next challenge.', '2004-10-13 05:54:08.000000', NULL, 0),
