(957299, 110132, 24925, '<td valign="top">I see this is your first entry...keep it up, we look forward to seeing more from you!<br/> <br/>I think the focus was the reason that this placed last.  You had the right idea and a little more care would have allowed for a much better score.  The subject could have also been placed in front of a more dramatic background (perhaps a solid black, white or colour).<br/> <br/>The first photo I submitted entered last, but in the 5 or 6 challenges since I have improved my photography skills dramatically and I''m very glad I stuck around to learn from the other members here.  I hope to see more of your entries in the future!</td>', 'I see this is your first entry...keep it up, we look forward to seeing more from you! I think the focus was the reason that this placed last.  You had the right idea and a little more care would have allowed for a much better score.  The subject could have also been placed in front of a more dramatic background (perhaps a solid black, white or colour). The first photo I submitted entered last, but in the 5 or 6 challenges since I have improved my photography skills dramatically and I''m very glad I stuck around to learn from the other members here.  I hope to see more of your entries in the future!', '2004-10-13 09:34:54.000000', NULL, 0),
