(957671, 109041, 19035, '<td valign="top">I was going more artistic with this shot, I knew it wouldn''t have wide appeal, but I really liked it.  I chose to oversharpen and over contrast the photo and at least some seemed to like it.  Thanks to all who gave me comments, appreciate them, good or bad.</td>', 'I was going more artistic with this shot, I knew it wouldn''t have wide appeal, but I really liked it.  I chose to oversharpen and over contrast the photo and at least some seemed to like it.  Thanks to all who gave me comments, appreciate them, good or bad.', '2004-10-13 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(957724, 109314, 7778, '<td valign="top">Simple, commotive, gritty and confidently composed. Given the poor showing of your competition in this challenge, I had slated a ribbon for this photo. I''m afraid your creativity was punished by minds not sensitized to it. Adversity, however, is as good for art as it is for those who oppose it.<br/> <br/>A clean heel, as rennie has hinted, would, also IMO, improve the photo. There is faint but discernible haloing separating the sole of the shoes from the surrounding negative space (probably caused by contrast and/or sharpness manipulation). These are minor considerations given the gist and graphic provocation of this image. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Simple, commotive, gritty and confidently composed. Given the poor showing of your competition in this challenge, I had slated a ribbon for this photo. I''m afraid your creativity was punished by minds not sensitized to it. Adversity, however, is as good for art as it is for those who oppose it. A clean heel, as rennie has hinted, would, also IMO, improve the photo. There is faint but discernible haloing separating the sole of the shoes from the surrounding negative space (probably caused by contrast and/or sharpness manipulation). These are minor considerations given the gist and graphic provocation of this image.  ', '2004-10-13 13:31:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(957745, 109872, 3417, '<td valign="top">she was not blown out as some say.  this is exactly the way she looked.  the sun was very bright that day.  i did nothing in photoshop in anyway.  i thought you were not permitted to in the first place.</td>', 'she was not blown out as some say.  this is exactly the way she looked.  the sun was very bright that day.  i did nothing in photoshop in anyway.  i thought you were not permitted to in the first place.', '2004-10-13 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(957746, 110456, 18667, '<td valign="top">Your image had no 1''s.  That is an amazing accomplishment in itself around here!  Good shot.</td>', 'Your image had no 1''s.  That is an amazing accomplishment in itself around here!  Good shot.', '2004-10-13 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(957784, 110331, 18708, '<td valign="top">Thank you every one for you helpful comments.</td>', 'Thank you every one for you helpful comments.', '2004-10-13 14:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(958025, 109200, 15832, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju með fyrsta sætið!!!<br/>Frábært að sjá þig á toppnum. Þessi mynd rokkar...<br/>Nú er það bara næsti ribbon, og enn einn íslendingur komin með Master réttindi;)</td>', 'Til hamingju með fyrsta sætið!!!Frábært að sjá þig á toppnum. Þessi mynd rokkar...Nú er það bara næsti ribbon, og enn einn íslendingur komin með Master réttindi;)', '2004-10-13 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(958065, 109813, 26500, '<td valign="top">I think technique was good in this shot.  It was just one of the shots in this massive challenge that I just sailed right over.  Nothing really caught my eye but I noticed the good focus and and least some thought of composition so I gave it a 6.  If it had been more interesting to me I would have rated it higher.  Unfortunately in  this challenge with 440 entries I didn''t have time to really give this photo the consideration it was due.  If I had to do it over I would probably give it between a 6 and 7 depending on if I had my afternoon caffeine.</td>', 'I think technique was good in this shot.  It was just one of the shots in this massive challenge that I just sailed right over.  Nothing really caught my eye but I noticed the good focus and and least some thought of composition so I gave it a 6.  If it had been more interesting to me I would have rated it higher.  Unfortunately in  this challenge with 440 entries I didn''t have time to really give this photo the consideration it was due.  If I had to do it over I would probably give it between a 6 and 7 depending on if I had my afternoon caffeine.', '2004-10-13 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 0),
