(958680, 110241, 8891, '<td valign="top">I did a different version of this. The color is richer and there is less a question of focus or DOF. I like the color better but there is something about the DOF at the top of the first leading the eye down to the point that I think I miss in the new version.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=112705" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/112705.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/112705.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/112705.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-13 23:06:58.</i></td>', 'I did a different version of this. The color is richer and there is less a question of focus or DOF. I like the color better but there is something about the DOF at the top of the first leading the eye down to the point that I think I miss in the new version. ', '2004-10-14 00:06:13.000000', '2004-10-14 00:06:58.000000', 0),
