(1169520, 109331, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is very "eye" catching!  I think I would have cropped more off of the bottom to cut the ground portion out of the frame, but it''s also nice just as is.  How in the world did you get this close to a zebra?  lighting could have been a little better, but you pretty much take what you can get with animal shots.  Congratulations on a wonderful photo.</td>', 'This is very "eye" catching!  I think I would have cropped more off of the bottom to cut the ground portion out of the frame, but it''s also nice just as is.  How in the world did you get this close to a zebra?  lighting could have been a little better, but you pretty much take what you can get with animal shots.  Congratulations on a wonderful photo.', '2005-02-14 19:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1183719, 109331, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture and a good viewpoint. I think the only way to have improved this would be to get a bit more light near the eye area and to get in even closer, edging out any sense of background context.</td>', 'Lovely texture and a good viewpoint. I think the only way to have improved this would be to get a bit more light near the eye area and to get in even closer, edging out any sense of background context.', '2005-02-20 12:42:57.000000', NULL, 0),
