(1199831, 110564, 7151, '<td valign="top">Hey Buzz, don''t know if you''r checking in regularly, but I was just browsing through my old "favorite photographers" list to see if anyone from the old CPAUG gang had done anything lately here and ran across this.  I was shocked when I saw the score it got.  This is a great action shot, and I think the "parts" framing really makes it an interesting photo.</td>', 'Hey Buzz, don''t know if you''r checking in regularly, but I was just browsing through my old "favorite photographers" list to see if anyone from the old CPAUG gang had done anything lately here and ran across this.  I was shocked when I saw the score it got.  This is a great action shot, and I think the "parts" framing really makes it an interesting photo.', '2005-02-28 19:40:36.000000', NULL, 0),
