(1255755, 109331, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a tactile looking image, I can just feel that skin. Your zebra is very different (not to mention more co-opertaive) than the on I just shot [photographed!] - he wouldn''t show me his eye clearly!<br/> <br/>I was quite shocked to see this was almost identical, so I must have subconsciously have echoed it I think. Your DOF is far preferable though.</td>', 'What a tactile looking image, I can just feel that skin. Your zebra is very different (not to mention more co-opertaive) than the on I just shot [photographed!] - he wouldn''t show me his eye clearly! I was quite shocked to see this was almost identical, so I must have subconsciously have echoed it I think. Your DOF is far preferable though.', '2005-03-29 03:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
